r from one to a hundred, and an Inquisitor picks one after them, with a die that does not cheat.\nA wrong guess costs a follower and earns a fresh piece of paperwork; a correct one triggers one of 16 endings, each with its own animation, its own obituary and its own achievement, assigned at random. Runs last two to four minutes.\n\nThe whole game is played through a text interface drawn in a Commodore-era palette.", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pray-your-god", "videos": [{"id": 193701, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "lVv6Boc0Gqw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lVv6Boc0Gqw", "title": "Pray Your God! \u2014 Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lVv6Boc0Gqw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}